just use what works for you."],["Application ID"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores."],["Application description"],["Set the application description for the game."],["Window title"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine."],["Window width"],["Set the default window width for the game."],["Window height"],["Set the default window height for the game."],["Full screen"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode."],["Resizable"],["Set the game window to be resizable."],["Game icon"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable."],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder."],["Start the application in full screen mode"],["Allow the application to be resizable"],["HTML Compiler"],["Compile"],["Source path can not empty"],["Destination path can not empty"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],[