 PHP CLI to run some mandatory procedure.<br />\n\t\t\t\tThis error usually occurred because your computer is <b>not installed with the <a href=\"http://dreamsavior.net/download/#TPPSysreq\">correct version of Microsoft Visual C++ redistributable</a></b>.\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"blockBox warningBlock withIcon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Please install the <a href=\"http://dreamsavior.net/download/#TPPSysreq\">required runtime</a>.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>And please move the Translator++ installation directory to other folder if you have installed all the runtime and still having this error.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\tPlease check the <a href='http://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/faq/have-installed-all-required-vc-redist-but-still-got-an-error/'>documentation</a> for more information about this symptom."],["Initialization Error!"]],"context":[["tid/2886/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2890/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"sys.js","dirname":"/js","extension":".js","filename":"sys.js","path":"/js/sys.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<b>Unable to run PHP Interpreter!</b><br />\n\t\t\t\tTranslator++ need PHP CLI to run some mandatory procedure.<br />\n\t\t\t\tThis error usually occurred because your computer is <b>not installed with the <a href=\"http://dreamsavior.net/download/#TPPSysreq\">correct version of Microsoft Visual C++ redistributable</a></b>.\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"blockBox warningBlock withIcon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Please install the <a href=\"http://dreamsavior.net/download/#TPPSysreq\">required runtime</a>.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>And please move the Translator++ installation directory to other folder if you have installed all the runtime and still having this error.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\tPlease check the <a href='http://dreamsavior.net/docs/translator/faq/have-installed-all-required-vc-redist-but-still-got-an-error/'>documentation</a> for more information about this symptom.":0,"Init